# Where the LLVM tools of each host come from. A host with a URL takes
# them from that release archive, whose SHA-256 digest is the one on the
# release page. A host marked built takes them from a build of our own,
# because the Linux release needs the ICU of one distribution. The
# version stands in tools/llvm-version alone, and @VERSION@ below takes
# it. LLVM publishes no archive for macOS on x86_64, so that host is built too.
